Description: Set keyboard auto-repeat on Wayland, like xset r rate
 wset changes keyboard auto-repeat on Wayland, with the same commands as xset:
 wset r rate 210 30 sets a 210 ms delay and 30 repeats per second. It supports
 GNOME and Sway, and wset q shows the settings any compositor uses.

